            {
              "id": "1765490193621_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Input:\n{{$context.$nodes.REFINE_PROGRAM_DATA.$output.result}}  — an array of Program objects. \n\nGenerate  a messageListWidget with\nTitle: Program name <name from each row>\nSubtitle: <subtitle from each row>\n\nPriority: <priority from each row>\nBadgeText: <badgeText from each row>\nTimestamp: Do not include Timestamp in response\nSummary: Generate one sentence to describe overall program health:\n       Most tactics exceed → Doing great, successful, strong engagement, healthy conversations\n       Most tactics meet → Stable  on track, moderate engagement, healthy conversations\n       Any tactics below OR most underperform → At risk, low engagement, weak or limited conversations\n      Example (do not hardcode):\n            “This program is performing well with strong engagement and healthy customer conversations.”\naction: \"ora.Invoke(\"NavigateToPrograms\",programId=<id>,programType=<{{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_PRODUCT_NAME_AND_CODE.$output.result.programType}}>)\"\n\nInclude the Subtitle text also inde the output result as it show below of Title text and above of Summary text\n\nHard Rules: Do not include any percentage or calculations in the response. Do not include tactics in the response. Do not include duplicate programs in the response\n"
            },
            {
              "id": "1765490193619_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Output must have only the oraInfoDisplay output. No other text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
